%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-strings-functions-ordinalize (関数ページ)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import * from dw::core::Strings
output application/json
---
{
  "a" : ordinalize(1),
  "b": ordinalize(2),
  "c": ordinalize(5),
  "d": ordinalize(103)
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "a": "1st",
  "b": "2nd",
  "c": "5th",
  "d": "103rd"
}
